            "subtitle": "Guides, Manuals, Parts & Support",
            "text": "<p>VBRM16 COMBO</p><p>Discover all you need to know about the OcuMow™ Drop and Mow robotic lawnmower with trimmer and whether this is the right robot for your garden. Learn how to set up, use and update your robot with instruction manuals, user guides, videos and FAQs.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "black",
