        "entry_7X3jzH": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "Can I use the grass trimmer battery in the robot mower?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, both the VBEM16 OcuMow robot and grass trimmer are part of our MX 24V Shared Battery System.</p><p>Every MX 24V 4.0 AH battery and charger is compatible with the LawnMaster MX 24V cordless range. So you can expand your cordless garden power tool collection in a cost effective and environmentally conscious way.</p>",
